# md on a Today entry, typing tomorrow and Enter saves tomorrow's date and the entry leaves Today.
file <<END
- Report @due({today})
- Mail @due({today})
END
keys gt
see Report
keys md
see Due date
type tomorrow
keys <Enter>
hide Report
see ▌ - Mail
quit
saved <<END
- Report @due({today+1})
- Mail @due({today})
END
